ent-BaseWeaponRevolver = 基礎武器：左輪手槍 | BaseWeaponRevolver
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponRevolverDeckard = 德卡德 | Deckard
    .desc = 一把工藝精湛、量身訂製的左輪手槍。當無暇進行沃伊特-坎普夫測試時便會使用。可裝填 5 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A beautifully machined, custom-built revolver. Used when there is no time for the Voight-Kampff test. Loads 5 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverInspector = 督察 | Inspector
    .desc = 一款由多家公司生產的雙動式左輪手槍。此槍在民用市場上隨處可見，因此深受私家偵探青睞。光是握在手中，便讓人覺得好運眷顧。可裝填 6 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A double-action revolver manufactured by various companies. It is readily available on the civilian market, making it a popular choice among private investigators. You feel lucky just holding it. Loads 6 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverMateba = 馬特巴 | Mateba
    .desc = 這是納諾特雷森（Nanotrasen）轄下近乎傳說般的「死亡小隊」特種部隊所使用的現代左輪手槍。其獨特的扳機機構與槍管配置，使其能在槍口上揚極小的前提下，達到極高的射速。許多人曾直面這支槍管，但鮮少有人能倖存下來講述這段經歷。可裝填 6 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A modern revolver used by Nanotrasen’s elite, near mythical ‘Death Squad’ task force. Its unique trigger action and barrel placement enable a high fire rate with minimal muzzle flip. Many have looked down this barrel, but few have lived to tell of it. Loads 6 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverMatebaAP = { ent-WeaponRevolverMateba }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponRevolverMateba.desc }
    .suffix = armor-piercing
ent-WeaponRevolverPython = Python | Python
    .desc = 一款由「辛迪加」製造的強大雙動式左輪手槍。聲勢浩大且耀眼奪目，非常適合任何想要展現存在感的特工。可裝填 6 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A powerful double-action revolver manufactured by the Syndicate. Loud and flashy, perfect for any agent looking to make a statement. Loads 6 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverPythonAP = { ent-WeaponRevolverPython }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponRevolverPython.desc }
    .suffix = armor-piercing
ent-WeaponRevolverPirate = 海盜左輪手槍 | pirate revolver
    .desc = 一把由太空海盜親手打造的粗糙單動式左輪手槍。雖然年代久遠且鏽跡斑斑，卻不知為何仍能正常運作。可裝填 5 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A crude single-action revolver handmade by a space pirate. Old and covered in rust, it somehow still works. Loads 5 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverPirateEmpty = { ent-WeaponRevolverPirate }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponRevolverPirate.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
